<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Abidjan bourse edges higher again on week.</title>
<headline>Abidjan bourse edges higher again on week.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Abidjan bourse edged higher again on the week, with the all-share index adding 0.73 percent to 507.15.</p>
<p>The index has now risen almost 42 percent this year.</p>
<p>Rubber producer SOGB was again in demand, rising 2,070 CFA francs to 22,900. Bank BICICI rose another 4,160 to 44,820. -- Abidjan newsroom, +225 21 90 90</p>
</text>
